# docs/_measured/ is intentionally NOT ignored.
#
# These are the generated reports -- measured dataset profile, idempotency
# evidence, partition benchmark, compaction before/after, quality gate,
# throughput ledger. They are the difference between a repo that describes
# a pipeline and one that proves it ran. Someone cloning this should see
# the numbers without having to run anything.
#
# Regenerate with the matching make target; they are reproducible, not precious.
# dbt writes a local anonymous-usage id here; not project state.
dbt/.user.yml
